# Important Note

FTCS is **unconditionally unstable for the pure advection equation**.

The purpose of these implementations is educational and to understand:

- Discretization
- Time Integration
- Boundary Conditions
- Solver Structure

Stable schemes such as FTBS, Lax-Friedrichs, Lax-Wendroff, and MacCormack will be implemented next.

